00:32:18.347 --> 00:32:19.972
- [Man] No, we owned and operated.

00:32:19.972 --> 00:32:20.805
- Keep going.

00:32:20.805 --> 00:32:22.264
- [Man] Me and my
culinary partner, Jordan,

00:32:22.264 --> 00:32:23.097
it's just two of us.

00:32:23.097 --> 00:32:23.930
- Love it.

00:32:23.930 --> 00:32:25.400
- [Man] So we were out there
a lot going back and forth

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:27.020
