just been like awesome.

00:32:31.820 --> 00:32:32.653
So super stoked.

00:32:32.653 --> 00:32:34.367
- Cliche, you were stretched too thin.

00:32:34.367 --> 00:32:35.785
When you focused, it worked.

00:32:35.785 --> 00:32:36.618
- [Man] A hundred percent.

00:32:36.618 --> 00:32:39.540
We grew and we shouldn't
have, then stretched too thin.

00:32:39.540 --> 00:32:41.526
It was a silly idea,
I think to start with.

00:32:41.526 --> 00:32:43.930
And then we just kind of
reshuffled and now it's actually

00:32:43.930 --> 00:32:44.880
clicking and working.

00:32:44.880 --> 00:32:46.616
