00:36:26.140 --> 00:36:28.770
And they're like, it's like
I've been very consistent here,

00:36:28.770 --> 00:36:30.510
that's what we're doing here.

00:36:30.510 --> 00:36:31.343
Right Jessie?

00:36:31.343 --> 00:36:32.720
Like it's been super consistent.

00:36:35.026 --> 00:36:37.387
But people love to
pontificate and theorize.

00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:42.680
It's why I hate the advice
that you guys get from not,

00:36:42.680 --> 00:36:44.780
I'm gonna say something
that I genuinely believe.

00:36:44.780 --> 00:36:48.530
Anytime a non-actual
operating entrepreneur

00:36:48.530 --> 00:36:50.580
or friend of yours gives you advice,

00:36:50.580 --> 00:36:52.140
