fuck you're talking about.

00:36:54.474 --> 00:36:57.370
(laughing)

00:36:57.370 --> 00:37:00.240
It's why I've gotten really quiet.

00:37:00.240 --> 00:37:01.260
One of the things I'm most proud of

00:37:01.260 --> 00:37:03.210
is I talk about the
same shit in my content

00:37:03.210 --> 00:37:04.780
because I'm not willing to go to places

00:37:04.780 --> 00:37:06.240
where I'm not willing to go anymore.

00:37:06.240 --> 00:37:08.630
I don't know what it's
like in those other places.

00:37:08.630 --> 00:37:10.100
Like I have theories.

00:37:10.100 --> 00:37:13.170
I have hypotheses, but until
you walk in a man's shoes

00:37:13.170 --> 00:37:14.223
you just don't know.

00:37:15.470 --> 00:37:17.250
And especially entrepreneurship.

00:37:17.250 --> 00:37:20.233
It just, you know, people
are talking theory.

00:37:21.180 --> 00:37:24.990
It's what people that are too
socially liberal in trouble.

00:37:24.990 --> 00:37:26.420
And I'm socially liberal as fuck.

00:37:26.420 --> 00:37:28.130
But like everything's great in theory.

00:37:28.130 --> 00:37:29.860
Now go execute it.

00:37:29.860 --> 00:37:31.660
Go read communism.

00:37:31.660 --> 00:37:32.990
It's amazing.

00:37:32.990 --> 00:37:35.620
No really, go read Marxism.

00:37:35.620 --> 00:37:37.393
It's super, like, I want it.

00:37:39.330 --> 00:37:41.700
Just doesn't, it's not how humans work.

00:37:41.700 --> 00:37:43.700
And that's how I think about business.

00:37:43.700 --> 00:37:46.313
Cool, yeah, you shouldn't micromanage.

00:37:47.470 --> 00:37:48.600
That's nice.

00:37:48.600 --> 00:37:51.105
You're going to a job tomorrow
that's going to pay you.

00:37:51.105 --> 00:37:53.860
I have to go in here and
be the last line defense

00:37:53.860 --> 00:37:54.693
of my business

00:37:54.693 --> 00:37:56.800
and right now, nobody's
doing email marketing

00:37:56.800 --> 00:37:57.840
and I haven't hired anybody to do it,

00:37:57.840 --> 00:37:59.308
so I'm gonna do it.

00:37:59.308 --> 00:38:00.193
Like, you know what I mean?

00:38:02.290 --> 00:38:06.720
We're in limbo, our chief
strategy officer left last week

00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:07.580
